{'symbol': 'LVS', 'date': '2022-12-08 00:11:00', 'title': 'SANDS SUPPLIER EXCELLENCE AWARDS AND SANDS PROCUREMENT ACADEMY GRADUATION HONOUR SUPPLIERS AND SMES', 'text': "SANDS CHINA RECOGNISES OUTSTANDING SUPPLIERS AND RECENTLY TRAINED LOCAL SMES MACAO , DEC. 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SANDS CHINA LTD. HONOURED SOME OF ITS MOST OUTSTANDING SUPPLIERS DEC. 2 AT A JOINT EVENT AT THE LONDONER® MACAO, WHERE THE COMPANY ALSO RECOGNISED LOCAL SMES GRADUATING FROM ITS PROCUREMENT TRAINING PROGRAMME, HIGHLIGHTED SOME OF THE SUCCESS STORIES OF SANDS CHINA'S ONGOING PARTNERSHIPS WITH ITS LOCAL SME SUPPLIERS, AND RAN A BUSINESS MATCHING SESSION TO CONNECT LOCAL SME SUPPLIERS WITH REPRESENTATIVES OF VARIOUS SANDS CHINA DEPARTMENTS."}